====================================================================================================
3. TRAINING MATRICES AND MISSING-VALUE POLICY (training rows only)   [0.0 min]
====================================================================================================
training    : 28,050 hours; PM2.5 missing 818 (2.92 %) in 162 gaps (median 1 h, 90th pct 4 h, max 343 h); 87 % of the gaps last <= 3 h
POLICY      : (1) the TARGET is never imputed - hours whose PM2.5(t+1) is missing are dropped; (2) the CURRENT PM2.5(t) must be observed (persistence needs it); (3) PM2.5 HISTORY features (lags, rolling) use a causal last-observation-carried-forward over gaps <= 3 h, longer gaps make the row unusable; (4) other pollutants / meteorology / wind direction are imputed INSIDE each training fold (SimpleImputer: median / most frequent). The rule depends on availability only and is applied identically to every model and to the test period.
usable rows : 26,000 of 28,050 training hours (92.7 %): missing target 818, observed target but missing current PM2.5 162, insufficient history 1232   [first 168 hours have no complete history]

